          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I would check the January 2 United award first: it reports 55,000 United miles, fewer than the January 1 United lead, while keeping the same program. The tradeoff is that this is only a date-level lead, not a complete itinerary; the search results contain no complete selectable award journey, and search coverage was partial.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A5@2027-01-02/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 2 United award lead\",\"v\":\"The result reports economy from SFO to BKK for 55,000 United miles, 9 seats, and USD 24.50 in award taxes and fees. The fee scope is unknown, so it is not established as a per-traveler or total quote. The schedule is date-only; carriers listed are BR, ET, SQ, UA, and ZH, but the result does not give flight times or a leg-by-leg cabin. Treat the reported seats and price as leads to verify, not confirmed availability or a bookable itinerary.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For an earlier date, the January 1 United lead reports 60,500 United miles—5,500 more than the January 2 lead—and 9 seats. Its USD 28.20 fee quote also has unknown scope. It shares the same key limitation: only the date is provided, without a usable schedule or leg-by-leg cabin.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 1 United award lead\",\"v\":\"This economy award summary reports SFO to BKK for 60,500 United miles, 9 seats, and USD 28.20 in award taxes and fees. Fee scope is unknown. The schedule is date-only, with CA, UA, and ZH listed as carriers; times, connection details, and cabin by leg are not supplied.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The January 4 Alaska lead is another program to investigate, not a like-for-like points comparison with the United options. It reports fewer points numerically, but points are in a different program; its reported USD fee is also a different amount, with unknown scope. It is later than either United date and still has no schedule beyond the date.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A12@2027-01-04/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"January 4 Alaska award lead\",\"v\":\"This economy award summary reports 42,500 Alaska miles, 8 seats, and USD 50.90 in award taxes and fees for SFO to BKK. The fee scope is unknown. The schedule is date-only; AS and JX are listed as carriers, but the result does not supply flight times, connection details, or cabin by leg.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"As a cash reference, the shown fare is for one traveler and includes one stop, but its price scope is unknown; it therefore cannot be treated as a confirmed all-in or per-person comparison with the award fee quotes. Confirm current award availability, schedules, cabins by leg, and full booking prices before deciding.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash fare reference\",\"v\":\"USD 640.00 is reported for one traveler on a one-stop SFO–HKG–BKK itinerary, departing January 1 at 10:55 p.m. local time and arriving January 4 at 10:35 a.m. Bangkok time. Elapsed time is 44 hours 40 minutes. The fare's price scope is unknown, so this is a reference rather than a confirmed total-cost comparison.\"}]}",
